    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=562301697112671106&sectionId=562346128868115366)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","label":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","default":"<p>Why Menopause Sabotages Your Metabolism (And How to Fix It)&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text","label":"gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text","default":"<p>The #1 complaint from menopausal women isn't hot flashes—it's sudden, unexplainable weight gain.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","label":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","default":"<p>So why does your body suddenly \"betray\" you when menopause begins?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsFTmw7vzK_text","label":"ggsFTmw7vzK_text","default":"<p>The answer is the GLP-1 disruption in your gut.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gQzmPPxstfQnQ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gQzmPPxstfQnQ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"gGWMuYzewycKR_text","label":"gGWMuYzewycKR_text","default":"<p>When estrogen declines during menopause, two critical changes occur:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gBRefzwPsvJwl_text","label":"gBRefzwPsvJwl_text","default":"<p>1. Our gut microbiome—the source of natural GLP-1 production—becomes imbalanced</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwl6uLKQia_text","label":"ggwl6uLKQia_text","default":"<p>2. This GLP-1 deficiency triggers a hormonal chain reaction that manifests as:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_0","label":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_0","default":"<p>Stubborn <strong>belly fat</strong> that won't budge—GLP-1 is essential for proper fat metabolism</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_1","label":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_1","default":"<p>Embarrassing <strong>bloating</strong> that adds inches to your waistline overnight</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_2","label":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_2","default":"<p><strong>Brain fog</strong> that makes you feel like you're walking through molasses</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_3","label":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_3","default":"<p>Overwhelming <strong>fatigue</strong> that coffee can't fix</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_4","label":"gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_4","default":"<p>Intense <strong>food cravings</strong> that feel impossible to resist without GLP-1&#039;s appetite control</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6oVysJJxT_text","label":"gg6oVysJJxT_text","default":"<p>Restoring healthy GLP-1 levels by rebalancing your gut microbiome &nbsp;is the key that most menopause solutions miss completely.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHpOe1M_b5_text","label":"ggHpOe1M_b5_text","default":"<p><strong>Your body isn't broken—it just needs targeted support to rebuild its natural GLP-1 production pathway.</strong></p>"}],
